<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Finding the area of a farmer's trapezium-shaped field</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A farmer is designing a trapezium-shaped field. The two parallel sides measure <b>{@a@} m</b> and <b>{@b@} m</b>. The sloping sides are equal in length.</p>

<p>
To calculate how much land is available for planting, the farmer needs to determine the area of the field.
</p>

[[jsxgraph]]
    var a = {#a#};
    var b = {#b#};
    var h = {#h#};
    var slant = {#slant#};
    var diff = (a - b) / 2;
    
    var board = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(BOARDID, {
        boundingbox: [-2, h + 3, a + 4, -2],
        keepAspectRatio: true,
        showNavigation: false,
        showCopyright: false,
        pan: {enabled: false},
        zoom: {enabled: false}
    });
    
    // Points
    var p1 = board.create('point', [0, 0], {visible: false, fixed: true});
    var p2 = board.create('point', [a, 0], {visible: false, fixed: true});
    var p3 = board.create('point', [a - diff, h], {visible: false, fixed: true});
    var p4 = board.create('point', [diff, h], {visible: false, fixed: true});
    
    // Polygon
    board.create('polygon', [p1, p2, p3, p4], {
        fillColor: '#e6f2ff', fillOpacity: 0.8, fixed: true, highlight: false,
        borders: {strokeColor: 'black', strokeWidth: 2, fixed: true, highlight: false}
    });
    
    // Height line
    var h_base = board.create('point', [diff, 0], {visible: false, fixed: true});
    board.create('segment', [p4, h_base], {
        dash: 2, strokeColor: 'gray', strokeWidth: 2, fixed: true
    });
    
    // Right angle marker for height
    board.create('angle', [p2, h_base, p4], {radius: 1, type: 'square', strokeColor: 'gray', fixed: true, name: ''});
    
    // Labels
    board.create('text', [a/2, -0.7, a + " m"], {anchorX: 'middle', anchorY: 'top', fontSize: 14, fixed: true});
    board.create('text', [a/2, h + 0.7, b + " m"], {anchorX: 'middle', anchorY: 'bottom', fontSize: 14, fixed: true});
    board.create('text', [diff/2 - 0.5, h/2, slant.toFixed(1) + " m"], {anchorX: 'right', anchorY: 'middle', fontSize: 14, fixed: true});
    board.create('text', [a - diff/2 + 0.5, h/2, slant.toFixed(1) + " m"], {anchorX: 'left', anchorY: 'middle', fontSize: 14, fixed: true});
    board.create('text', [diff + 0.3, h/2, "h = " + h + " m"], {anchorX: 'left', anchorY: 'middle', fontSize: 14, fixed: true});
[[/jsxgraph]]

<p>
Give your answer correct to <b>2 decimal places</b>.
</p>

<p>
Area = [[input:ans1]] <b>\(\text{m}^2\)</b> [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]
</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked solution</h3>

<p>
The area of a trapezium is given by:
\[
\text{Area} = \frac{1}{2}(a + b) \times h
\]
where:
<ul>
<li>\(a\) and \(b\) are the lengths of the parallel sides</li>
<li>\(h\) is the perpendicular height</li>
</ul>
</p>

<p>
From the diagram:
<ul>
<li>Bottom base: \(a = {@a@}\) m</li>
<li>Top base: \(b = {@b@}\) m</li>
<li>Height: \(h = {@h@}\) m</li>
</ul>
</p>

<p><strong>Substitute into the formula:</strong></p>
<p>
\[
\text{Area} = \frac{1}{2}({@a@} + {@b@}) \times {@h@}
\]
</p>

<p>
\[
\text{Area} \approx {@Area_disp@} \text{ m}^2
\]
</p>

<p>
Therefore, the area of the field is:
</p>

<p>
\[
\boxed{{@Area_disp@}\text{ m}^2}
\]
</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
